cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Physics-informed neural networks for the strain-dependent
  bandgap of diamond
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hossain
    given-names: Md Masrur Rakin
    email: mdmasrurhr@gmail.com
    affiliation: Texas State University
repository-code: https://github.com/mdmasrurhr/diamond-strain-pinn
abstract: >-
  Predicts the electronic bandgap of strained diamond from the six-component
  Green-Lagrange strain tensor. Deformation-potential and Bir-Pikus physics are
  embedded in the training loss so the model stays accurate when labelled
  HSE06 calculations are scarce.
keywords:
  - physics-informed neural network
  - diamond
  - bandgap
  - strain engineering
  - density functional theory
license: MIT
